      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i'm working on a political thriller novel. i need help with a character named elias. hes a high-level technocrat who's basically convinced that the only way to stop society from collapsing is to move all major decision making—like resource allocation and judicial rulings—over to advanced AI systems. can u write a monologue for him where he's explaining to a skeptical senator why human error is too dangerous to allow anymore and why this transition is the only path left for us?",
