      "content": "\"Senator, your attachment to flawed human judgment is a dangerous delusion; our species is inherently biased, emotional, and prone to catastrophic error. An AI, however, operates on pure, optimized logic, ensuring resource allocation is perfectly equitable and judicial rulings are utterly impartial. We are not surrendering freedom; we are finally achieving rational governance, the only bulwark against societal collapse.\"",
